  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.teamkugimiya.org/banners/ModsTranslationPack.png\" alt=\"横幅\"></p><p><strong>本资源包专为繁体中文模组社区设计。使用繁体中文以外的语言可能导致翻译缺失。</strong></p><p>一个包含海量模组翻译的资源包~\n目前已支持 <strong>556</strong> 款模组！</p><p>如果您希望以更简便的方式获取翻译而无需使用Git版本控制，可以查看我们的社区版：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fparatranz.cn%252fprojects%252f9900\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ParaTranslationPack</a></p><hr><h2>🌐 安装翻译包</h2><p>下载对应版本并放入游戏资源包文件夹即可加载！</p><p>不同版本翻译包的区别在于部分模组在不同Minecraft版本中可能存在翻译差异。</p><p>同时推荐安装以下模组来提升整体繁体中文体验：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PRP</a>：PRP是修复部分基于Patchouli的指南书中翻译显示的补丁模组，部分模组指南需要此模组才能正确显示</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/untranslated-ite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">未翻译物品</a>：此模组可让您查看物品的原始英文名称，并支持通过英文名称进行搜索。</p><h2>✨ 第三方翻译来源</h2><p>部分翻译由第三方贡献者提供。</p><p>例如当某个模组自带中文翻译但尚未更新到新版，或因其他原因时，我们可能会在包中直接收录部分第三方翻译。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CFPAOrg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CFPA团队</a><br><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamKugimiya/MMLP-CN-to-ZW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MMLP-CN-to-ZW</a><br></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CLOVERsquare\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CLOVERsquare</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/SmashingMods/Alchemistry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">炼金化学</a><br></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Jimmy-sheep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jimmy-sheep</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CoFH/CoFHCore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoFH核心</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CoFH/ThermalCore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">热力核心</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/CoFH/ThermalFoundation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">热力基础</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliand665\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Julian Dunskus</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/juliand665/Dynamic-FPS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态FPS</a><br></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhome.gamer.com.tw%252fhomeindex.php%253fowner%253dminecraft15\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">steak0902</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.gamer.com.tw%252fC.php%253fbsn%253d18673%2526snA%253d196127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸工程</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgrant88.pixnet.net%252fblog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant88</a><ul>\n<li>更多信息请查看GitHub</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin社区</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fsodium-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">钠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fsodium-extra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">钠扩展</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomMods - Pau1am</a><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomLib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomLib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomHomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomHomes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomTpa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomTpa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomBack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomBack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomWarps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomWarps</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/BlossomMods/BlossomPVP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlossomPVP</a></li></ul></li>\n</ul><h2>💫 贡献者</h2><p>感谢以下贡献者，让更多玩家能够享受完整的繁体中文模组体验！</p><table>\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/xMikux\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26039249?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"Miku\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>Miku</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/StarskyXIII\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71606873?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"StarskyXIII\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>StarskyXIII</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Ylite-cola\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140043701?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"特爾\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>特爾</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/obscure-man\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59750952?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"obscure_man\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>obscure_man</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Jeffku0107\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76643322?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"旺財\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>旺財</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/alan198731520\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47174565?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"alan198731520\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>alan198731520</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/yichifauzi\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31981880?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"dirtTW\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>dirtTW</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/rhuba8324\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53090204?v=4\" width=\"100;\" alt=\"rhuba8324\">\n        <br>\n        <strong>rhuba8324</strong>\n      </a>\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      <a href